*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0014
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 953
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0014.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> TRANSACTIONS IN LAST 24 HOURS
    05 TRAN-CNT-DAY       PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 ACCT-OPEN-DAYS     PIC 9(5).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> RISK LEVEL H/M/L
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 RISK-SCORE         PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "RISK-SCORE=" RISK-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    IF TRAN-CNT-DAY > 15 AND TXN-AMT > 4000
        MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 90 TO RISK-SCORE
    *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
    ELSE IF TRAN-CNT-DAY GREATER THAN 8
        MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 60 TO RISK-SCORE
    *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT
    ELSE IF ACCT-OPEN-DAYS < 60
        MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 40 TO RISK-SCORE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
        MOVE 10 TO RISK-SCORE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
